Title: Dense draft head subset (vocabulary pruning for MTP / speculative drafting)
Add-on: Keeps the top N most frequent vocabulary rows (and special tokens) of the output head
in GPU VRAM for draft steps. Cuts MTP draft step latency from 9 ms to 0.15 ms.
Verification pass remains full-head and mathematically exact.

